<Layout title="Washington DC Architect | ATECT Architecture" description="Architectural design services for residential and commercial projects in Washington, DC, including renovations, additions, custom homes and construction documents.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">Washington DC Architect</div><h1>Architectural design for projects throughout Washington DC.</h1><p>ATECT Architecture provides residential and commercial architectural design, construction documents and visualization services for clients planning new spaces, additions, renovations and custom projects.</p></section>
<section class="section intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">Architecture &amp; Design Services</div><h2>Design support from concept through construction documents.</h2><p>Every project begins with understanding the property, the goals and the practical requirements of the work. ATECT Architecture develops thoughtful design solutions and clear documentation tailored to each project.</p><p>Services can include residential architecture, home additions, custom home design, commercial design, construction documents, permit drawing services and 3-D architectural visualization.</p></div><div class="location-card"><div class="eyebrow">Service Area</div><h3>Washington DC</h3><p>Serving clients throughout the area with professional architectural design and documentation services.</p><a href="/contact">Start a Project →</a></div></section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Services</div><h2>How ATECT Can Help</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Explore the services most relevant to your project.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><a href="/residential-architecture"><span>Residential Architecture</span><strong>Additions, renovations & new homes →</strong></a><a href="/home-addition-design"><span>Home Addition Design</span><strong>Plan an addition with confidence →</strong></a><a href="/custom-home-design"><span>Custom Home Design</span><strong>Create a home around your needs →</strong></a><a href="/architectural-construction-documents"><span>Construction Documents</span><strong>Clear drawings for construction →</strong></a><a href="/permit-drawing-services"><span>Permit Drawing Services</span><strong>Prepare documentation for review →</strong></a><a href="/3d-architectural-renderings"><span>3D Architectural Renderings</span><strong>Visualize the design before it is built →</strong></a></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Selected Work</div><h2>Explore ATECT Projects</h2></div><p class="section-intro">See examples of residential, commercial and custom home design work.</p></div><div class="project-links"><a href="/projects/residential"><span>Residential Projects</span><strong>View Residential Work →</strong></a><a href="/projects/commercial"><span>Commercial Projects</span><strong>View Commercial Work →</strong></a><a href="/projects/custom-homes"><span>Custom Home Plans</span><strong>Explore Custom Homes →</strong></a><a href="/3d-renderings"><span>3-D Renderings</span><strong>View Visualization Work →</strong></a></div></section>
<section class="section alt process"><div class="eyebrow">Start Your Project</div><h2>Let's talk about what you're planning.</h2><p>Whether you are considering an addition, renovation, custom home, commercial project or construction-document package, ATECT can help define the next step.</p><a class="button dark" href="/contact">Start a Project</a></section>
</Layout>
<style is="global">
.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(280px,.7fr);gap:clamp(40px,7vw,100px);align-items:start}.intro h2,.section-head h2,.process h2{font:600 clamp(34px,4.5vw,58px)/1.05 Manrope;margin:0 0 22px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.intro p,.process p{color:#555;line-height:1.8;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 20px}.location-card{background:#f3f1ec;padding:34px;border-top:4px solid #111}.location-card h3{font:600 30px/1.1 Manrope;margin:8px 0 14px}.location-card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}.location-card a{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;color:#111;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #111;padding-bottom:4px}.service-grid,.project-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:42px}.service-grid a,.project-links a{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;min-height:140px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease}.service-grid a:hover,.project-links a:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#111}.service-grid span,.project-links span{font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#777}.service-grid strong,.project-links strong{font-size:17px;line-height:1.4}.process{text-align:center}.process p{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 28px}.process .button{display:inline-block}@media(max-width:850px){.intro{grid-template-columns:1fr}.service-grid,.project-links{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:560px){.service-grid,.project-links{grid-template-columns:1fr}.location-card{padding:26px}.intro h2,.section-head h2,.process h2{font-size:38px}}
</style>